1
00:00:00,888 --> 00:00:03,938
(Raj(doorbell rings):)Oh, I'll get it.

2
00:00:03,941 --> 00:00:05,641
(Bernadette:)It didn't help that you couldn't
walk a straight line

3
00:00:05,643 --> 00:00:07,813
(Bernadette:)when the cop pulled you over.

4
00:00:07,812 --> 00:00:11,482
(Howard:)I have performance anxiety.

5
00:00:12,567 --> 00:00:15,567
(Howard:)You of all people
should know that.

6
00:00:25,329 --> 00:00:27,499
(Raj:)Hello.

7
00:00:27,498 --> 00:00:29,248
(Air Force Officer:)I'm looking for Howard Wolowitz.

8
00:00:29,250 --> 00:00:33,340
(Raj:)Howard Wolowitz?

9
00:00:33,337 --> 00:00:35,557
(Air Force Officer:)I have the right address,
don't I?

10
00:00:35,556 --> 00:00:38,336
(Raj:)Address?

11
00:00:38,342 --> 00:00:39,972
(Air Force Officer:)Is he here?

12
00:00:39,977 --> 00:00:43,677
(Raj:)Um... no.

13
00:00:43,681 --> 00:00:45,731
(Air Force Officer:)Do you know where
I can find him?

14
00:00:45,733 --> 00:00:48,063
(Raj:)May I ask what this is about?

15
00:00:48,069 --> 00:00:49,519
(Air Force Officer:)No, you may not.

16
00:00:49,520 --> 00:00:50,900
(Sheldon:)Very well.

17
00:00:55,326 --> 00:00:57,196
(Air Force Officer:)Have him call me.

18
00:00:57,195 --> 00:00:58,415
(Sheldon:)Okay.

19
00:00:58,412 --> 00:01:04,022
(Howard(off):)Raj, who's at the door?

